    .rangeos-chevron when the toggle's aria-expanded turns true, so the markup is the
    same either way. Decorative: the toggle carries the label and the expanded state.

    Shares the glyph set's 24x24 box and 2.2 stroke; see local_rangeos/icon_search.

    Context variables required: none.

    Example context (json):
    { }
}}
